            "basis": "action",
            "tax_denominator": 50
          }
        ],
        "assumptions": [
          "Assumes 2,000 smelts per hour. Adjust the rate to match your own pace.",
          "The 10% extra-bar chance at 27 Smithing is not included in this estimate."
